{"logId": "2c2ac0ca-0c5c-4d4b-b4b7-4c76e54b279f", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 3958, "height": 6106, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "鳃具 12 分枝，此外，侧触手很长，位于头部前缘。", "block_bbox": [265, 590, 1936, 693], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[265.0, 590.0], [1936.0, 590.0], [1936.0, 693.0], [265.0, 693.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [601, 769, 3148, 3467], "block_id": 1, "block_order": null, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[601.0, 769.0], [3148.0, 769.0], [3148.0, 3467.0], [601.0, 3467.0]]}, {"block_label": "figure_title", "block_content": "图 3 寡鳃拟疣虫（新种）", "block_bbox": [1533, 3521, 2406, 3614], "block_id": 2, "block_order": null, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[1533.0, 3521.0], [2406.0, 3521.0], [2406.0, 3614.0], [1533.0, 3614.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "1. 体前端；2. 第8刚节疣足；3. 第8刚节上的鳃；", "block_bbox": [1292, 3617, 2608, 3702], "block_id": 3, "block_order": null, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[1292.0, 3617.0], [2608.0, 3617.0], [2608.0, 3702.0], [1292.0, 3702.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "4. 腹刚毛；5. 短的毛状刚毛；6. 长的毛状刚毛", "block_bbox": [1340, 3704, 2593, 3787], "block_id": 4, "block_order": null, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[1340.0, 3704.0], [2593.0, 3704.0], [2593.0, 3787.0], [1340.0, 3787.0]]}, {"block_label": "figure_title", "block_content": "叶须虫科 PHYLLODOCIDAE Williams，1852", "block_bbox": [974, 3919, 2967, 4043], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[974.0, 3919.0], [2967.0, 3919.0], [2967.0, 4043.0], [974.0, 4043.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "属和种的检索表", "block_bbox": [1692, 4158, 2243, 4255], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[1692.0, 4158.0], [2243.0, 4158.0], [2243.0, 4255.0], [1692.0, 4255.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 疣足双叶型，触手5个（背叶虫属 Notophyllum）。酒精标本绿或褐色，背须上具黑色斑点 …… 华彩背叶虫 N. splendens\n1. 疣足单叶型，触手4个（叶须虫属 Phyllodoce）……2\n2. 吻后部的乳突排列不规则（叶须虫属 Phyllodoce），触须较长，后伸可达第11—12节 …… 长丝叶须虫 P. fristedti\n2. 吻后部的乳突规则地排成纵行（纵突虫亚属 Anaitides）。背须卵圆形，似棱；吻后部具12纵行乳突 …… 梭须叶须虫 P. (Anaitides) madeirensis", "block_bbox": [248, 4380, 3693, 5283], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[248.0, 4380.0], [3693.0, 4380.0], [3693.0, 5283.0], [248.0, 5283.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "428", "block_bbox": [248, 5647, 386, 5723], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[248.0, 5647.0], [386.0, 5647.0], [386.0, 5723.0], [248.0, 5723.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7029958963394165, "coordinate": [265, 590, 1936, 693], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[265.0, 590.0], [1936.0, 590.0], [1936.0, 693.0], [265.0, 693.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.933154284954071, "coordinate": [601, 769, 3148, 3467], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[601.0, 769.0], [3148.0, 769.0], [3148.0, 3467.0], [601.0, 3467.0]]}, {"cls_id": 7, "label": "figure_title", "score": 0.8529026508331299, "coordinate": [1533, 3521, 2406, 3614], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1533.0, 3521.0], [2406.0, 3521.0], [2406.0, 3614.0], [1533.0, 3614.0]]}, {"cls_id": 24, "label": "vision_footnote", "score": 0.508353054523468, "coordinate": [1292, 3617, 2608, 3702], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1292.0, 3617.0], [2608.0, 3617.0], [2608.0, 3702.0], [1292.0, 3702.0]]}, {"cls_id": 24, "label": "vision_footnote", "score": 0.6894475817680359, "coordinate": [1340, 3704, 2593, 3787], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1340.0, 3704.0], [2593.0, 3704.0], [2593.0, 3787.0], [1340.0, 3787.0]]}, {"cls_id": 7, "label": "figure_title", "score": 0.3899804651737213, "coordinate": [974, 3919, 2967, 4043], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[974.0, 3919.0], [2967.0, 3919.0], [2967.0, 4043.0], [974.0, 4043.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.40486711263656616, "coordinate": [1692, 4158, 2243, 4255], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[1692.0, 4158.0], [2243.0, 4158.0], [2243.0, 4255.0], [1692.0, 4255.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4371282458305359, "coordinate": [248, 4380, 3693, 5283], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[248.0, 4380.0], [3693.0, 4380.0], [3693.0, 5283.0], [248.0, 5283.0]]}, {"cls_id": 15, "label": "inline_formula", "score": 0.5401574373245239, "coordinate": [1820, 4783, 2338, 4880], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[1820.0, 4783.0], [2338.0, 4783.0], [2338.0, 4880.0], [1820.0, 4880.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.33145764470100403, "coordinate": [240, 5037, 3679, 5269], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[240.0, 5037.0], [3679.0, 5037.0], [3679.0, 5269.0], [240.0, 5269.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7319826483726501, "coordinate": [248, 5647, 386, 5723], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[248.0, 5647.0], [386.0, 5647.0], [386.0, 5723.0], [248.0, 5723.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "鳃具 12 分枝，此外，侧触手很长，位于头部前缘。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_601_769_3148_3467.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"64%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">图 3 寡鳃拟疣虫（新种）</div>\n\n\n1. 体前端；2. 第8刚节疣足；3. 第8刚节上的鳃；\n\n4. 腹刚毛；5. 短的毛状刚毛；6. 长的毛状刚毛\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">叶须虫科 PHYLLODOCIDAE Williams，1852</div>\n\n\n## 属和种的检索表\n\n1. 疣足双叶型，触手5个（背叶虫属 Notophyllum）。酒精标本绿或褐色，背须上具黑色斑点 …… 华彩背叶虫 N. splendens\n\n1. 疣足单叶型，触手4个（叶须虫属 Phyllodoce）……2\n\n2. 吻后部的乳突排列不规则（叶须虫属 Phyllodoce），触须较长，后伸可达第11—12节 …… 长丝叶须虫 P. fristedti\n\n2. 吻后部的乳突规则地排成纵行（纵突虫亚属 Anaitides）。背须卵圆形，似棱；吻后部具12纵行乳突 …… 梭须叶须虫 P. (Anaitides) madeirensis", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_601_769_3148_3467.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c2ac0ca-0c5c-4d4b-b4b7-4c76e54b279f/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_601_769_3148_3467.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-11-23T14%3A18%3A23Z%2F-1%2F%2F2eb572210faf3470d826ae0b0fde64d79c2e99ce4c1072f57b386e4f2267e19c"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c2ac0ca-0c5c-4d4b-b4b7-4c76e54b279f/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-11-23T14%3A18%3A26Z%2F-1%2F%2Fd66f4ea8ad34789fc21c5c79bbcb141ae04b51cc3c2329dd74c6b7d22fbf8d1b"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c2ac0ca-0c5c-4d4b-b4b7-4c76e54b279f/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-11-23T14%3A18%3A26Z%2F-1%2F%2Fb7f978474a50fe36cf5bb856782728b2921c28d3040ec38915a471ff6fc20bf6"}, {"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 3958, "height": 6106, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "18. 长丝叶须虫 Phyllodoce fristedti Bergström (图 1, 1—2)", "block_bbox": [352, 606, 2577, 716], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[352.0, 606.0], [2577.0, 606.0], [2577.0, 716.0], [352.0, 716.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "Phyllodoce fristedti Bergstom, 1914:152, fig. 49, pl. III. 1; Fauvel, 1953:118, fig. 58, a–b; Rullier, 1972:53.\n标本采集地：我国西沙晋卿岛26ⅣⅣ1958（1标本）。", "block_bbox": [343, 747, 3595, 966], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[343.0, 747.0], [3595.0, 747.0], [3595.0, 966.0], [343.0, 966.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我们仅有一个不完整的标本，体长 35 mm，宽 2 mm。口前叶为心脏形，后面具一脑后突起。吻后部具很多排列不规则的小乳突。", "block_bbox": [183, 997, 3604, 1232], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 997.0], [3604.0, 997.0], [3604.0, 1232.0], [183.0, 1232.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我们的标本与 Bergström 和 Fauvel 的描述不同处是触须较长，后伸可达第 11—12 节 (Bergström 等描述的触须仅达第 6—7 节)，背须为圆叶形，长为宽的 3 倍 (Bergström 等描述长为宽的 2 倍)。酒精标本为淡褐色，腹部为乳白色。", "block_bbox": [178, 1256, 3612, 1627], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[178.0, 1256.0], [3612.0, 1256.0], [3612.0, 1627.0], [178.0, 1627.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "附注：1939年；Fauvel报告在越南发现短丝叶须虫Phyllodoce laminosa Savigny。短丝叶须虫分布在大西洋和地中海，它与长丝叶须虫很近似，不同处是背须较宽短；Fauvel的描述很简单，又无附图，很可能是长丝叶须虫。", "block_bbox": [186, 1654, 3598, 2011], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[186.0, 1654.0], [3598.0, 1654.0], [3598.0, 2011.0], [186.0, 2011.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "地理分布：印度、斯里兰卡（？）、越南、新喀里多尼亚岛。常栖于海藻中。本种在我国是首次记录。", "block_bbox": [188, 2042, 3614, 2277], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[188.0, 2042.0], [3614.0, 2042.0], [3614.0, 2277.0], [188.0, 2277.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "19. 梭须叶须虫 Phyllodoce (Anaitides) madeirensis Langerhans", "block_bbox": [354, 2304, 2762, 2411], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[354.0, 2304.0], [2762.0, 2304.0], [2762.0, 2411.0], [354.0, 2411.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "Phyllodoce madeirensis: Fauvel, 1932: 70; Okuda, 1937: 269, fig. 10; Fauvel, 1939: 275.", "block_bbox": [350, 2439, 3059, 2539], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[350.0, 2439.0], [3059.0, 2439.0], [3059.0, 2539.0], [350.0, 2539.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "Phyllodoce (Anaitides) madeirensis: Fauvel, 1953:120, fig. 59, d–h; Fishelson and Rullier, 1969: 58; Rullier, 1972: 54; Day, 1973a:23; Day, 1973b:343.", "block_bbox": [186, 2575, 3613, 2795], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[186.0, 2575.0], [3613.0, 2575.0], [3613.0, 2795.0], [186.0, 2795.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "Anaitides madeirensis: Imajima and Hartman, 1964: 60; Hartman, 1966:183.", "block_bbox": [349, 2835, 2689, 2932], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[349.0, 2835.0], [2689.0, 2835.0], [2689.0, 2932.0], [349.0, 2932.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "标本采集地：我国西沙永兴岛30 III 1958 (1标本)，15 V 1958 (1标本)，19 V 1958 (2标本)，21 V 1958 (1标本)。", "block_bbox": [186, 2960, 3614, 3192], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[186.0, 2960.0], [3614.0, 2960.0], [3614.0, 3192.0], [186.0, 3192.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我们的标本均不完整，最大的体长 128 mm，宽 (体最宽处，包括疣足) 5 mm。吻后部具 12 纵行乳突 (每边 6 行)，背须普通为卵圆状，似梭。", "block_bbox": [197, 3219, 3615, 3458], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 3219.0], [3615.0, 3219.0], [3615.0, 3458.0], [197.0, 3458.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "附注：梭须叶须虫与纤细叶须虫 P. (Anaitides) tenuissima Grube 非常相似，两者仅是体色有区别，前者酒精标本为黄白或浅褐色，后者为黄色并具深蓝色带珠光横纹。1953 年，Fauvel 认为纤细叶须虫是梭须叶须虫的一个变种。1964 年，今岛实 (Imajima) 和 Hartman 认为除日本南部标本外，产于日本田边湾 (Tanabe Bay) 的标本是不是梭叶须虫，值得怀疑。因为 Fauvel (1936) 报道的是一个失去体色的小标本，口前叶长于宽；吻上的结构也没有描述。", "block_bbox": [194, 3489, 3618, 4109], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[194.0, 3489.0], [3618.0, 3489.0], [3618.0, 4109.0], [194.0, 4109.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "地理分布：葡萄牙、大西洋东部、地中海、红海、印度洋、非洲东南部、澳大利亚、新喀里多尼亚岛、越南和日本。本种在我国是首次记录。", "block_bbox": [196, 4134, 3614, 4369], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[196.0, 4134.0], [3614.0, 4134.0], [3614.0, 4369.0], [196.0, 4369.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "20. 华彩背叶虫 Notophyllum splendens (Schmarda)", "block_bbox": [362, 4398, 2312, 4507], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[362.0, 4398.0], [2312.0, 4398.0], [2312.0, 4507.0], [362.0, 4507.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "Notophyllum splendens: Augener, 1913:140, fig. 11; Monro, 1934:351.", "block_bbox": [363, 4533, 2523, 4629], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[363.0, 4533.0], [2523.0, 4533.0], [2523.0, 4629.0], [363.0, 4629.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "标本采集地：我国西沙永兴岛(底栖生物拖网采)，15 V 1958 (1标本)。", "block_bbox": [362, 4658, 3172, 4763], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[362.0, 4658.0], [3172.0, 4658.0], [3172.0, 4763.0], [362.0, 4763.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "体长 8 mm，宽 1 mm。酒精标本绿或褐色，背须上有黑色斑点。体内具成熟的大形卵。我们的标本是退潮后在珊瑚礁浅水洼中用蜉蝣拖到的。", "block_bbox": [206, 4786, 3620, 5026], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[206.0, 4786.0], [3620.0, 4786.0], [3620.0, 5026.0], [206.0, 5026.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "附注：1964年，Imajima 和 Hartman 从背叶虫属 Notophyllum 中分出一新属——日本背叶虫属 Nipponotophyllum，后者与背叶虫属很相似，两者的区别仅是后者的第1须节具两对触须和刚毛，背叶虫属的第1须虫具一对触须，无刚毛。我们的标本完全符合背叶虫属的鉴证。", "block_bbox": [203, 5051, 3622, 5414], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[203.0, 5051.0], [3622.0, 5051.0], [3622.0, 5414.0], [203.0, 5414.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "地理分布：菲律宾、斯里兰卡、印度、澳大利亚、新喀里多尼亚岛和加勒比海。本", "block_bbox": [371, 5437, 3627, 5549], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[371.0, 5437.0], [3627.0, 5437.0], [3627.0, 5549.0], [371.0, 5549.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "429", "block_bbox": [3496, 5662, 3625, 5738], "block_id": 20, "block_order": null, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[3496.0, 5662.0], [3625.0, 5662.0], [3625.0, 5738.0], [3496.0, 5738.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8398060202598572, "coordinate": [352, 606, 2577, 716], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[352.0, 606.0], [2577.0, 606.0], [2577.0, 716.0], [352.0, 716.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7004634737968445, "coordinate": [343, 747, 3595, 966], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[343.0, 747.0], [3595.0, 747.0], [3595.0, 966.0], [343.0, 966.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9222385287284851, "coordinate": [183, 997, 3604, 1232], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[183.0, 997.0], [3604.0, 997.0], [3604.0, 1232.0], [183.0, 1232.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.939879298210144, "coordinate": [178, 1256, 3612, 1627], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[178.0, 1256.0], [3612.0, 1256.0], [3612.0, 1627.0], [178.0, 1627.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9383721947669983, "coordinate": [186, 1654, 3598, 2011], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[186.0, 1654.0], [3598.0, 1654.0], [3598.0, 2011.0], [186.0, 2011.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9136261343955994, "coordinate": [188, 2042, 3614, 2277], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[188.0, 2042.0], [3614.0, 2042.0], [3614.0, 2277.0], [188.0, 2277.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7939023375511169, "coordinate": [354, 2304, 2762, 2411], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[354.0, 2304.0], [2762.0, 2304.0], [2762.0, 2411.0], [354.0, 2411.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7099032998085022, "coordinate": [350, 2439, 3059, 2539], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[350.0, 2439.0], [3059.0, 2439.0], [3059.0, 2539.0], [350.0, 2539.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6870591044425964, "coordinate": [186, 2575, 3613, 2795], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[186.0, 2575.0], [3613.0, 2575.0], [3613.0, 2795.0], [186.0, 2795.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4888180196285248, "coordinate": [349, 2835, 2689, 2932], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[349.0, 2835.0], [2689.0, 2835.0], [2689.0, 2932.0], [349.0, 2932.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9141212105751038, "coordinate": [186, 2960, 3614, 3192], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[186.0, 2960.0], [3614.0, 2960.0], [3614.0, 3192.0], [186.0, 3192.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.923247754573822, "coordinate": [197, 3219, 3615, 3458], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 3219.0], [3615.0, 3219.0], [3615.0, 3458.0], [197.0, 3458.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9587187767028809, "coordinate": [194, 3489, 3618, 4109], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[194.0, 3489.0], [3618.0, 3489.0], [3618.0, 4109.0], [194.0, 4109.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9171898365020752, "coordinate": [196, 4134, 3614, 4369], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[196.0, 4134.0], [3614.0, 4134.0], [3614.0, 4369.0], [196.0, 4369.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8223337531089783, "coordinate": [362, 4398, 2312, 4507], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[362.0, 4398.0], [2312.0, 4398.0], [2312.0, 4507.0], [362.0, 4507.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7794297933578491, "coordinate": [363, 4533, 2523, 4629], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[363.0, 4533.0], [2523.0, 4533.0], [2523.0, 4629.0], [363.0, 4629.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8293753862380981, "coordinate": [362, 4658, 3172, 4763], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[362.0, 4658.0], [3172.0, 4658.0], [3172.0, 4763.0], [362.0, 4763.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9272698760032654, "coordinate": [206, 4786, 3620, 5026], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[206.0, 4786.0], [3620.0, 4786.0], [3620.0, 5026.0], [206.0, 5026.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9368634819984436, "coordinate": [203, 5051, 3622, 5414], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[203.0, 5051.0], [3622.0, 5051.0], [3622.0, 5414.0], [203.0, 5414.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8366265296936035, "coordinate": [371, 5437, 3627, 5549], "order": 20, "polygon_points": [[371.0, 5437.0], [3627.0, 5437.0], [3627.0, 5549.0], [371.0, 5549.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7585042715072632, "coordinate": [3496, 5662, 3625, 5738], "order": 21, "polygon_points": [[3496.0, 5662.0], [3625.0, 5662.0], [3625.0, 5738.0], [3496.0, 5738.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "### 18. 长丝叶须虫 Phyllodoce fristedti Bergström (图 1, 1—2)\n\nPhyllodoce fristedti Bergstom, 1914:152, fig. 49, pl. III. 1; Fauvel, 1953:118, fig. 58, a–b; Rullier, 1972:53.\n\n标本采集地：我国西沙晋卿岛26ⅣⅣ1958（1标本）。\n\n我们仅有一个不完整的标本，体长 35 mm，宽 2 mm。口前叶为心脏形，后面具一脑后突起。吻后部具很多排列不规则的小乳突。\n\n我们的标本与 Bergström 和 Fauvel 的描述不同处是触须较长，后伸可达第 11—12 节 (Bergström 等描述的触须仅达第 6—7 节)，背须为圆叶形，长为宽的 3 倍 (Bergström 等描述长为宽的 2 倍)。酒精标本为淡褐色，腹部为乳白色。\n\n附注：1939年；Fauvel报告在越南发现短丝叶须虫Phyllodoce laminosa Savigny。短丝叶须虫分布在大西洋和地中海，它与长丝叶须虫很近似，不同处是背须较宽短；Fauvel的描述很简单，又无附图，很可能是长丝叶须虫。\n\n地理分布：印度、斯里兰卡（？）、越南、新喀里多尼亚岛。常栖于海藻中。本种在我国是首次记录。\n\n### 19. 梭须叶须虫 Phyllodoce (Anaitides) madeirensis Langerhans\n\nPhyllodoce madeirensis: Fauvel, 1932: 70; Okuda, 1937: 269, fig. 10; Fauvel, 1939: 275.\n\nPhyllodoce (Anaitides) madeirensis: Fauvel, 1953:120, fig. 59, d–h; Fishelson and Rullier, 1969: 58; Rullier, 1972: 54; Day, 1973a:23; Day, 1973b:343.\n\nAnaitides madeirensis: Imajima and Hartman, 1964: 60; Hartman, 1966:183.\n\n标本采集地：我国西沙永兴岛30 III 1958 (1标本)，15 V 1958 (1标本)，19 V 1958 (2标本)，21 V 1958 (1标本)。\n\n我们的标本均不完整，最大的体长 128 mm，宽 (体最宽处，包括疣足) 5 mm。吻后部具 12 纵行乳突 (每边 6 行)，背须普通为卵圆状，似梭。\n\n附注：梭须叶须虫与纤细叶须虫 P. (Anaitides) tenuissima Grube 非常相似，两者仅是体色有区别，前者酒精标本为黄白或浅褐色，后者为黄色并具深蓝色带珠光横纹。1953 年，Fauvel 认为纤细叶须虫是梭须叶须虫的一个变种。1964 年，今岛实 (Imajima) 和 Hartman 认为除日本南部标本外，产于日本田边湾 (Tanabe Bay) 的标本是不是梭叶须虫，值得怀疑。因为 Fauvel (1936) 报道的是一个失去体色的小标本，口前叶长于宽；吻上的结构也没有描述。\n\n地理分布：葡萄牙、大西洋东部、地中海、红海、印度洋、非洲东南部、澳大利亚、新喀里多尼亚岛、越南和日本。本种在我国是首次记录。\n\n### 20. 华彩背叶虫 Notophyllum splendens (Schmarda)\n\nNotophyllum splendens: Augener, 1913:140, fig. 11; Monro, 1934:351.\n\n标本采集地：我国西沙永兴岛(底栖生物拖网采)，15 V 1958 (1标本)。\n\n体长 8 mm，宽 1 mm。酒精标本绿或褐色，背须上有黑色斑点。体内具成熟的大形卵。我们的标本是退潮后在珊瑚礁浅水洼中用蜉蝣拖到的。\n\n附注：1964年，Imajima 和 Hartman 从背叶虫属 Notophyllum 中分出一新属——日本背叶虫属 Nipponotophyllum，后者与背叶虫属很相似，两者的区别仅是后者的第1须节具两对触须和刚毛，背叶虫属的第1须虫具一对触须，无刚毛。我们的标本完全符合背叶虫属的鉴证。\n\n地理分布：菲律宾、斯里兰卡、印度、澳大利亚、新喀里多尼亚岛和加勒比海。本", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c2ac0ca-0c5c-4d4b-b4b7-4c76e54b279f/layout_det_res_1.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-11-23T14%3A18%3A30Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff502c9a1ec9ee0d57c2ef7ce005d6a9637c2e46e92f022174e896899cd04fbb8"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c2ac0ca-0c5c-4d4b-b4b7-4c76e54b279f/input_img_1.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-11-23T14%3A18%3A31Z%2F-1%2F%2Fcb197e6a7100627aba83d1b2d3e2ad3fac7277f66e6548f428bebba288176d6b"}, {"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 4016, "height": 6136, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "种在我国烟台有分布。", "block_bbox": [577, 532, 1433, 655], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[577.0, 532.0], [1433.0, 532.0], [1433.0, 655.0], [577.0, 655.0]]}, {"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "海虫科 Hesionidae Malmgren, 1867", "block_bbox": [1536, 787, 3035, 940], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[1536.0, 787.0], [3035.0, 787.0], [3035.0, 940.0], [1536.0, 940.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "海虫属 Hesione 种的检索表", "block_bbox": [1819, 1030, 2748, 1149], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[1819.0, 1030.0], [2748.0, 1030.0], [2748.0, 1149.0], [1819.0, 1149.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 刚毛顶齿下方的小刺短;疣足顶端的两个锥形唇几乎等长。体背面具窄的褐色纵纹·", "block_bbox": [569, 1240, 3346, 1386], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[569.0, 1240.0], [3346.0, 1240.0], [3346.0, 1386.0], [569.0, 1386.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 刚毛顶齿下方的小刺长；疣足顶端的两个锥形唇，一个很长，一个非常短。体背面斑不排成纵纹…2", "block_bbox": [559, 1493, 3979, 1660], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[559.0, 1493.0], [3979.0, 1493.0], [3979.0, 1660.0], [559.0, 1660.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 体背面每个节上具圆和长圆形紫褐色斑不排成横行 …… 紫斑海虫 H. pantherina", "block_bbox": [558, 1623, 3984, 1793], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[558.0, 1623.0], [558.0, 1758.0], [3983.0, 1792.0], [3983.0, 1657.0], [3963.0, 1691.0], [3560.0, 1657.0], [3258.0, 1657.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 体背面每个节上有 5—6 个褐色斑，位正中的一个特别大，规则地排成横行 …… 横斑海虫 H. genetta", "block_bbox": [546, 1764, 3976, 1930], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[546.0, 1792.0], [546.0, 1874.0], [3975.0, 1929.0], [3975.0, 1820.0], [786.0, 1764.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "21. 紫斑海虫 Hesione pantherina Risso (图 2, 7—8)", "block_bbox": [716, 2023, 2691, 2167], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[716.0001831054688, 2023.0001220703125], [2691.6748046875, 2052.024658203125], [2689.900634765625, 2172.7861328125], [714.2260131835938, 2143.761474609375]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "Hesione pantherina: Fauvel, 1923: 233, fig. 87; Fauvel, 1930:285; Fauvel, 1953:104, fig. 49, a–g; Fishelson and Rullier, 1969:58; Rullier, 197256.", "block_bbox": [546, 2160, 3968, 2427], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[546.0, 2190.0], [546.0, 2397.0], [3967.0, 2426.0], [3967.0, 2220.0], [966.0, 2160.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "标本采集地：我国西沙永兴岛 15 V 1958 (1 标本)，21 V 1958 (3 标本)。", "block_bbox": [717, 2411, 3521, 2575], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[717.0, 2411.0], [717.0, 2509.0], [1161.0, 2542.0], [3520.0, 2574.0], [3520.0, 2444.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "大标本体长 48 mm，宽 11 mm，具 16 个刚节。", "block_bbox": [719, 2547, 2506, 2681], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[719.0, 2547.0], [2506.0, 2547.0], [2506.0, 2681.0], [719.0, 2681.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "体为柱形，后端细。口前叶为双叶形，眼4个，无触角，仅有两个很小的触手，触须8对。吻平滑，在其背面基部具一肉突。疣足单叶型，背须长，腹叶大，中空，具两根足刺，腹叶顶端有两个能伸缩的锥形唇。腹刚毛异齿型，端节为长镰刀形，顶端具两个齿，第2齿的下方有一根长齿。", "block_bbox": [536, 2675, 3967, 3228], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[536.0, 2675.0], [536.0, 3197.0], [3946.0, 3227.0], [3966.0, 2737.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "酒精标本体背面每个节上具有圆和长圆形的紫褐色斑，但有些标本色斑很不清楚，甚至全部褪去。", "block_bbox": [535, 3197, 3919, 3493], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[535.0, 3197.0], [535.0, 3433.0], [3918.0, 3492.0], [3918.0, 3257.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "讨论：紫斑海虫与横斑海虫 H. genetta Grube 极其相似，两者间的区别仅是后者的每个体节上具一横排大约 5—6 个褐色斑点，其中位于正中的一个特别大。关于色斑的不同，很多研究者认为与生殖有关，这有待进一步研究证实。1953 年，Fauvel 认为横斑海虫大概只能作为紫斑海虫的一个变种。", "block_bbox": [523, 3457, 3954, 4017], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[523.0, 3457.0], [523.0, 3954.0], [3953.0, 4016.0], [3953.0, 3489.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "紫斑海虫、横斑海虫和纵纹海虫 $ H.\\ intertexta\\ Grube $是近似种，三者之间除体色不同以外，Monro (1924)曾提出刚毛顶齿下方小刺的长度也是很重要的一个区别特征。紫斑海虫和横斑海虫小刺较短，其长度仅达第2顶齿。纵纹海虫的小刺较长，能与第1顶齿相接；除此以外，我们观察到疣足顶端的两个锥形唇，在紫斑海虫和横斑海虫等长或一个稍短一些。纵纹海虫的两个锥形唇一个很长；另一个非常短，仅稍能认出。从以上的比较，清楚地看出，这三种海虫除体色以外，在疣足和刚毛的特征上，都是有区别的。", "block_bbox": [505, 3982, 3947, 4802], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[526.0, 3982.0], [505.0, 4741.0], [3926.0, 4801.0], [3946.0, 4043.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1936年，Fauvel将网纹海虫 $ H.\\ reticulata $ Marenzeller列为紫斑海虫的同物异名是错误的。根据1879年Marenzeller的附图（图版III,4）小刺与第1顶齿相接；又据1912年，Izuka对网纹海虫的描述是体背面有纵贯全身的白色波纹，因此很清楚，网纹海虫实际是纵纹海虫 $ H.\\ intertexta $ Grube。1936年Fauvel、1938年Okuda曾报告日本的濑户内海和伊豆半岛分布有紫斑海虫，他们的描述很简单，在没有看到日本标本以前，是否是紫斑海虫，", "block_bbox": [490, 4766, 3931, 5463], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[511.0, 4766.0], [511.0, 5402.0], [3930.0, 5462.0], [3930.0, 4827.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "430", "block_bbox": [494, 5579, 633, 5662], "block_id": 16, "block_order": null, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[494.0, 5579.0], [633.0, 5579.0], [633.0, 5662.0], [494.0, 5662.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7552370429039001, "coordinate": [577, 532, 1433, 655], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[577.0, 532.0], [1433.0, 532.0], [1433.0, 655.0], [577.0, 655.0]]}, {"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.8434728980064392, "coordinate": [1536, 787, 3035, 940], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[1536.0, 787.0], [3035.0, 787.0], [3035.0, 940.0], [1536.0, 940.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5813871026039124, "coordinate": [1819, 1030, 2748, 1149], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[1819.0, 1030.0], [2748.0, 1030.0], [2748.0, 1149.0], [1819.0, 1149.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4210197627544403, "coordinate": [569, 1240, 3346, 1386], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[569.0, 1240.0], [3346.0, 1240.0], [3346.0, 1386.0], [569.0, 1386.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4589847922325134, "coordinate": [559, 1493, 3979, 1660], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[559.0, 1493.0], [3979.0, 1493.0], [3979.0, 1660.0], [559.0, 1660.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.49505746364593506, "coordinate": [558, 1623, 3984, 1793], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[558.0, 1623.0], [558.0, 1758.0], [3983.0, 1792.0], [3983.0, 1657.0], [3963.0, 1691.0], [3560.0, 1657.0], [3258.0, 1657.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5408730506896973, "coordinate": [546, 1764, 3976, 1930], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[546.0, 1792.0], [546.0, 1874.0], [3975.0, 1929.0], [3975.0, 1820.0], [786.0, 1764.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8190996646881104, "coordinate": [716, 2023, 2691, 2167], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[716.0001831054688, 2023.0001220703125], [2691.6748046875, 2052.024658203125], [2689.900634765625, 2172.7861328125], [714.2260131835938, 2143.761474609375]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8068000674247742, "coordinate": [546, 2160, 3968, 2427], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[546.0, 2190.0], [546.0, 2397.0], [3967.0, 2426.0], [3967.0, 2220.0], [966.0, 2160.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8034654259681702, "coordinate": [717, 2411, 3521, 2575], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[717.0, 2411.0], [717.0, 2509.0], [1161.0, 2542.0], [3520.0, 2574.0], [3520.0, 2444.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8057457208633423, "coordinate": [719, 2547, 2506, 2681], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[719.0, 2547.0], [2506.0, 2547.0], [2506.0, 2681.0], [719.0, 2681.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9267065525054932, "coordinate": [536, 2675, 3967, 3228], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[536.0, 2675.0], [536.0, 3197.0], [3946.0, 3227.0], [3966.0, 2737.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8820315003395081, "coordinate": [535, 3197, 3919, 3493], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[535.0, 3197.0], [535.0, 3433.0], [3918.0, 3492.0], [3918.0, 3257.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9298421144485474, "coordinate": [523, 3457, 3954, 4017], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[523.0, 3457.0], [523.0, 3954.0], [3953.0, 4016.0], [3953.0, 3489.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9493449926376343, "coordinate": [505, 3982, 3947, 4802], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[526.0, 3982.0], [505.0, 4741.0], [3926.0, 4801.0], [3946.0, 4043.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9345016479492188, "coordinate": [490, 4766, 3931, 5463], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[511.0, 4766.0], [511.0, 5402.0], [3930.0, 5462.0], [3930.0, 4827.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7239070534706116, "coordinate": [494, 5579, 633, 5662], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[494.0, 5579.0], [633.0, 5579.0], [633.0, 5662.0], [494.0, 5662.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "种在我国烟台有分布。\n\n# 海虫科 Hesionidae Malmgren, 1867\n\n## 海虫属 Hesione 种的检索表\n\n1. 刚毛顶齿下方的小刺短;疣足顶端的两个锥形唇几乎等长。体背面具窄的褐色纵纹·\n\n1. 刚毛顶齿下方的小刺长；疣足顶端的两个锥形唇，一个很长，一个非常短。体背面斑不排成纵纹…2\n\n2. 体背面每个节上具圆和长圆形紫褐色斑不排成横行 …… 紫斑海虫 H. pantherina\n\n2. 体背面每个节上有 5—6 个褐色斑，位正中的一个特别大，规则地排成横行 …… 横斑海虫 H. genetta\n\n### 21. 紫斑海虫 Hesione pantherina Risso (图 2, 7—8)\n\nHesione pantherina: Fauvel, 1923: 233, fig. 87; Fauvel, 1930:285; Fauvel, 1953:104, fig. 49, a–g; Fishelson and Rullier, 1969:58; Rullier, 197256.\n\n标本采集地：我国西沙永兴岛 15 V 1958 (1 标本)，21 V 1958 (3 标本)。\n\n大标本体长 48 mm，宽 11 mm，具 16 个刚节。\n\n体为柱形，后端细。口前叶为双叶形，眼4个，无触角，仅有两个很小的触手，触须8对。吻平滑，在其背面基部具一肉突。疣足单叶型，背须长，腹叶大，中空，具两根足刺，腹叶顶端有两个能伸缩的锥形唇。腹刚毛异齿型，端节为长镰刀形，顶端具两个齿，第2齿的下方有一根长齿。\n\n酒精标本体背面每个节上具有圆和长圆形的紫褐色斑，但有些标本色斑很不清楚，甚至全部褪去。\n\n讨论：紫斑海虫与横斑海虫 H. genetta Grube 极其相似，两者间的区别仅是后者的每个体节上具一横排大约 5—6 个褐色斑点，其中位于正中的一个特别大。关于色斑的不同，很多研究者认为与生殖有关，这有待进一步研究证实。1953 年，Fauvel 认为横斑海虫大概只能作为紫斑海虫的一个变种。\n\n紫斑海虫、横斑海虫和纵纹海虫 $ H.\\ intertexta\\ Grube $是近似种，三者之间除体色不同以外，Monro (1924)曾提出刚毛顶齿下方小刺的长度也是很重要的一个区别特征。紫斑海虫和横斑海虫小刺较短，其长度仅达第2顶齿。纵纹海虫的小刺较长，能与第1顶齿相接；除此以外，我们观察到疣足顶端的两个锥形唇，在紫斑海虫和横斑海虫等长或一个稍短一些。纵纹海虫的两个锥形唇一个很长；另一个非常短，仅稍能认出。从以上的比较，清楚地看出，这三种海虫除体色以外，在疣足和刚毛的特征上，都是有区别的。\n\n1936年，Fauvel将网纹海虫 $ H.\\ reticulata $ Marenzeller列为紫斑海虫的同物异名是错误的。根据1879年Marenzeller的附图（图版III,4）小刺与第1顶齿相接；又据1912年，Izuka对网纹海虫的描述是体背面有纵贯全身的白色波纹，因此很清楚，网纹海虫实际是纵纹海虫 $ H.\\ intertexta $ Grube。1936年Fauvel、1938年Okuda曾报告日本的濑户内海和伊豆半岛分布有紫斑海虫，他们的描述很简单，在没有看到日本标本以前，是否是紫斑海虫，", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c2ac0ca-0c5c-4d4b-b4b7-4c76e54b279f/layout_det_res_2.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-11-23T14%3A18%3A35Z%2F-1%2F%2F7d4495c0b4ff80bb69a58b3575a6c105cccc00a1ff2f56228c92ef9469639e0e"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c2ac0ca-0c5c-4d4b-b4b7-4c76e54b279f/input_img_2.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-11-23T14%3A18%3A35Z%2F-1%2F%2F00fe1fd6d273daab5dd12de7bc2c93584b8b9bef052c89aff4ff9cb69fb8fab0"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 3, "pages": [{"width": 3958, "height": 6106}, {"width": 3958, "height": 6106}, {"width": 4016, "height": 6136}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c2ac0ca-0c5c-4d4b-b4b7-4c76e54b279f/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-11-23T14%3A18%3A27Z%2F-1%2F%2F0e89391cff45a300de22c0b068fa1e3ef504c7d04bf329a62903d4fccd3e6722", "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c2ac0ca-0c5c-4d4b-b4b7-4c76e54b279f/preprocessed_img_1.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-11-23T14%3A18%3A31Z%2F-1%2F%2Fea02f67fe4271d32cfd96b1f959eb33e18cab6c4d728a708270a8f4073b125f6", "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c2ac0ca-0c5c-4d4b-b4b7-4c76e54b279f/preprocessed_img_2.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-11-23T14%3A18%3A35Z%2F-1%2F%2F5a01